 "remarks": "Welcome to 21 Culloden Road Unit 2, a spacious 4BR, 1 and 1/2 bath second floor unit with 2 off street parking spaces, situated in the highly desirable Glenbrook neighborhood. Meticulously maintained, this unit features four light-filled bedrooms, 1 1/2 baths, a large eat-in kitchen and in-unit laundry. Yard access is shared with downstairs unit and the oversized driveway provides assigned off-street parking for two vehicles.   Just minutes from the Glenbrook and Stamford Transportation Centers (Metro-North/Amtrak express to NYC), I-95, and Chelsea Piers. Enjoy easy access to Cove Island Park's beaches and the vibrant dining, shopping, and nightlife of Downtown Stamford.   Heat, hot water and cooking gas are included in the rent!!! Tenant only has to pay electric and cable/ internet.",
